        <ExplanationTxt>THE ENDOWMENT FUNDS ARE USED TO SUPPORT THE OLD GLOBE THEATRE.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART X, LINE 2:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE OLD GLOBE AND THE TRUST ARE EXEMPT FROM INCOME TAXES UNDER SECTION 501(C)(3) OF THE INTERNAL REVENUE CODE AND SECTION 23701(D) OF THE CALIFORNIA REVENUE AND TAXATION CODE. THE OLD GLOBE MAY BE SUBJECT TO FEDERAL OR STATE INCOME TAXES ON UNRELATED BUSINESS INCOME. FOR EACH OF THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2024 AND 2023, NO PROVISION FOR SUCH TAXES IS REQUIRED. THE OLD GLOBE HAS NO UNRECOGNIZED TAX BENEFITS OR LIABILITIES AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2024 AND 2023. THE OLD GLOBE AND THE TRUST FILE EXEMPT ORGANIZATION RETURNS IN THE UNITED STATES FEDERAL JURISDICTION AND WITH THE FRANCHISE TAX BOARD IN THE STATE OF CALIFORNIA.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
