        <ExplanationTxt>POTENTIAL CONFLICTS OF INTEREST ARE REVIEWED AND DETERMINED AT THE INVESTMENT COMMITTEE LEVEL. EACH MEMBER OF THE INVESTMENT COMMITTEE SHALL ANNUALLY SIGN A STATEMENT WHICH AFFIRMS THAT SUCH PERSON: HAS RECEIVED A COPY OF THE CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY, HAS READ AND UNDERSTANDS THE POLICY, AND HAS AGREED TO COMPLY WITH THE POLICY. IF A CONFLICT OF INTEREST ARISES, SUCH TRUSTEE SHALL NOT VOTE ON THE TRANSACTION. THERE HAVE BEEN NO INCIDENCES OF CONFLICT DURING THE YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2024.</ExplanationTxt>
